# Avengers Assemble!: "a Hero entered the battlefield under your control this turn" asks the permanent as it entered (CR
# 603.6a, 614.12), not as it is now. On turn 7 Bot1 casts Pet Avengers (a 4/4 Hero, 6/6 under the Avengers) and then Nameless
# Inversion on it: it loses all creature types, so it is no Hero any more and loses the +2/+2 as well, a 7/1 (4/4 and +3/-3).
# The Avengers' ability still finds that it entered as a Hero: Bot1, with an empty hand after the turn, draws 1 card at
# that end step, and turn 8's end step (the entry was the turn before) draws nothing more.

